[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0447","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0263","title":"Oracle Solaris SUNWadmap 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 操作系统中的 SUNWadmap 管理工具包（admintool）存在本地权限提升漏洞。admintool 程序以 setuid root 权限运行，本地普通用户可利用该程序在参数处理上的缺陷，以 root 权限执行任意命令，从而获取系统完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5、2.5.1、2.6 等多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地账户，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用。Sun 已发布安全公告（SunSolve Bulletin #173）提供修补方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0263"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:01Z","remediation":"建议立即移除 /usr/sbin/adm/admap 二进制文件的 setuid 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/adm/admap`；如无需使用 Solstice AdminSuite，可直接卸载 SUNWadmap 软件包：`pkgrm SUNWadmap`；同时安装 Sun 对应补丁（如 106235-xx 系列补丁，视 Solaris 版本而定）；限制 admap 仅授权管理员可执行，防止普通用户滥用提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/173"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1558","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1582","title":"Cisco PIX防火墙 established命令访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX 防火墙的 \"established\" 命令存在设计缺陷，当已经允许存在一条通道（conduit）时，该命令会允许一台主机通过任意端口连接到另一台目标主机。攻击者可在已有合法通道的基础上，绕过既定的访问控制策略，与目标主机上的任意端口建立连接。管理员若未充分理解此功能的行为机制，可能配置过于宽松的访问控制规则，导致网络安全性下降。该漏洞影响 Cisco PIX 防火墙系列产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1582"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"重新评估并严格控制 `established` 命令的使用范围，避免因理解偏差导致访问控制过于宽松。建议使用更精确的 access-list 规则替代 `established` 命令，逐条明确允许的源/目的地址和端口。若运行 PIX OS 6.x 及更早版本，请升级至 7.x 以上并迁移至基于 zone 的防火墙策略，配合 Cisco ASDM 进行可视化规则审计。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/pixest-pub.shtml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/6733","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8052","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1582.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1582.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1582","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1582.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1582.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9q5w-4wqw-v6f6/GHSA-9q5w-4wqw-v6f6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87942/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1582.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1461","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1461.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1297","title":"Sun OpenWindows cmdtool 和 SunOS Xview L2/AGAIN 密钥信息泄露漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.4及之前版本中的OpenWindows 3.0组件所包含的cmdtool终端模拟器及XView 3.0图形工具箱存在信息泄露漏洞。具有物理访问权限的攻击者可通过按下L2/AGAIN密钥，触发系统回显之前被隐藏的输入字符（如密码输入时的不可见字符），从而导致敏感信息被本地获取。该漏洞危害等级低，CVSS评分2.1，但利用条件要求攻击者拥有物理接触权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1297"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"升级 SunOS 至 4.1.4 以上版本，安装 Sun 官方补丁 ID 100482（针对 OpenWindows 3.0）和 100483（针对 XView 3.0）。如无法升级，可在系统控制台禁用 L2/AGAIN 键绑定功能，或限制物理访问权限以降低暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fpatches%2F100452&zone_32=10045%2A%20","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7482","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1297.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1297","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1297.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1297.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmmg-53q9-h849/GHSA-wmmg-53q9-h849.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87791/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1297.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000333.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a5f36eb9-0d57-4496-8acd-f46ac3367eda.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1461.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0399","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0213","title":"Sun Solaris rpcbind libnsl 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 的 rpcbind 服务中的 libnsl 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标系统的 rpcbind 服务发送特制的 RPC 请求，导致 libnsl 库处理异常，进而使 rpcbind 服务崩溃或进入不可响应状态。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.4、2.5、2.5.1 及 2.6 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害严重。厂商 Sun 已发布安全补丁，建议用户及时升级修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0213"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"建议安装 Sun 针对此漏洞发布的对应 Solaris 版本补丁集（如 Patch ID 106235 等），将系统升级至最新支持版本。如无法修补，可在 /etc/init.d/rpc 中禁用 rpcbind 服务，或在防火墙上限制外部对 UDP/TCP 端口 111 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9749"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1271","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1433","title":"HP JetAdmin 符号链接漏洞","description":"HP JetAdmin D.01.09 for Solaris 存在符号链接漏洞。当程序以特权权限运行时，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp/jetadmin.log 日志文件上创建符号链接，指向系统任意文件，从而在清理日志时覆盖或修改目标文件的权限，导致本地权限提升。该漏洞利用简单，无需身份认证即可发起攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1433"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-07-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"修改 /opt/hpnp/admin/jetadmin 脚本，在创建日志文件前使用 test -h 检测符号链接防止跟随；或将日志目录改为非世界可写的安全路径（如 /var/log/hpnp/）；还可移除 jetadmin 脚本的 setuid/setgid 权限位，避免低权限用户利用该漏洞进行提权攻击。如无需使用 HP JetAdmin 服务，建议直接卸载该软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525988&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104526067&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/157","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1433"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1271.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1271.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0028","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0006","title":"Qualcomm qpopper POP3 服务器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Qualcomm qpopper 2.4 及之前版本的 POP3 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送超长的 PASS 命令参数即可触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行并以 root 权限完全控制系统。该漏洞无需特殊权限即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0006"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 qpopper 至 2.5 及以上版本，该版本修复了 PASS 命令处理中的缓冲区边界检查缺陷。若无法升级，在 inetd/xinetd 配置中对 qpopper 服务启用 TCP wrapper 访问控制（hosts.allow/hosts.deny），限制允许连接 POP 服务的源 IP 范围。对于已停止维护的旧系统，建议迁移至现代 POP3/IMAP 服务器（如 Dovecot），并禁用不再安全的 POP3 协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/133"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1272","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1434","title":"Slackware Linux /etc/group 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Slackware Linux 3.2 至 3.5 版本的 login 程序在 /etc/group 文件缺失时未正确检查错误状态，导致无法正常降低用户权限。本地攻击者只需登录服务器即可获得 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞利用条件简单，无需额外工具或认证，影响所有运行受影响版本的 Slackware 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1434"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"升级至 Slackware 3.6 及以上版本以彻底修复该漏洞（3.6 已修复登录时 /etc/group 缺失不降权的问题）。如暂时无法升级，手动创建 /etc/group 文件并填入必要组条目（如 root:x:0:root、bin:x:1:root,bin,daemon），确保文件存在且权限为 644，作为临时缓解措施防范本地提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525951&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/155","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19122","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1434.json","htt