998-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:04Z","remediation":"升级到 KDE 1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复将 PGP 口令作为命令行参数传递的问题，改用标准输入传递口令防止被其他进程窃取。如无法升级，可使用 gpg-agent 缓存口令避免每次输入。限制不可信用户登录系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.kde.org/?l=kde-devel&m=90221974029738&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1639","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1270.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1270","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1270.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1270.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5m8h-jjf9-c2p5/GHSA-5m8h-jjf9-c2p5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87816/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1270.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-214.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_infor.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1519","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1435","title":"Socks 5 libsocks5 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Socks 5（socks5）1.0r5 版本中 libsocks5 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 socks5 服务传递超长的环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现权限提升，获得更高系统权限。该漏洞影响 Socks 5 1.0r5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1435"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:26Z","remediation":"升级 Socks 5 至 1.0r6 及以上版本，该版本已修复 libsocks5 库中环境变量长度检查缺失导致的缓冲区溢出问题。若无法升级，可在启动服务前对 TMPDIR、LOGNAME 等环境变量做长度校验和过滤以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525933&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1435.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1435","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1435.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1435.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cvxv-497g-895g/GHSA-cvxv-497g-895g.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/154/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1435.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000329.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0235","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0235.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0102","title":"SLmail 3.x 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SLmail 3.x 邮件服务器在处理邮件头 FROM 字段时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送含有超长 FROM 行的特制邮件触发该漏洞，导致内存越界写入，从而实现以邮件服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SLmail 3.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0102"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 SLMail 至 3.2.0.3 以上版本，该版本修复了 FROM 行缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，应在边界防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 SMTP 端口（25/tcp），并考虑迁移至长期维护的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix 或 Exchange）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0102"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1273","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1436","title":"Ray Chan WWW Authorization Gateway 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Ray Chan WWW Authorization Gateway 0.1 是一款 CGI 程序，其 user 参数存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该参数传递 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）来执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击门槛低，危害严重。受影响的版本为 WWW Authorization Gateway 0.1，建议用户立即升级或停止使用该组件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1436"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:26Z","remediation":"立即从 Web 服务器 cgi-bin 目录删除或禁用 www_authorization_gateway.cgi 脚本，改用支持现代认证机制的替代方案（如 Apache mod_auth_openidc 或 OAuth 2.0），该程序已停止维护无法通过升级修复。如暂时无法移除，必须在代码中对 user 参数传入 system() 或 exec() 前过滤 shell 元字符（; | & ` $ ( ) { } 等），并对所有 CGI 输入启用 Perl taint 模式以防止命令注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525905&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/152","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19121","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a131a61f179c398a4ef435924df81458086a9cb6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1436","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4bbdea96409f626865dff84d61afd8c20a6e888a/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-14xx/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7dc55cca89001dc2f7c29b1a9d052c5037532843/1999/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1436.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/bc073bb1970e46c0d143cf7fc40855c10a7513a4/api/1999/CVE-1999-1436.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1273.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1273.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1274","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1437","title":"Ralf S. Engelschall ePerl 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"eperl 2.2.12 版本中存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 bar.phtml 传递目标文件的完整路径作为参数，即可读取服务器上的任意文件，并可能进一步执行特定命令。该漏洞影响 eperl 2.2.12 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1437"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:26Z","remediation":"建议升级至 ePerl 2.3.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 CGI 模式下 ISINDEX 查询参数导致 MODE_CGI 误判、将参数当文件路径打开解析的问题。如无法升级，可迁移至 mod_perl 等仍在维护的替代方案；临时缓解措施包括在 Web 服务器层面对 ePerl 脚本的 QUERY_STRING 参数进行严格校验，禁止包含文件路径等内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525890&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525927&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/151","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19120","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a131a61f179c398a4ef435924df81458086a9cb6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1437.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1437","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-1999-1437.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1437.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1437.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-74xc-6hpg-hp8m/GHSA-74xc-6hpg-hp8m.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1437.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000327.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e155fb1f-b408-4597-af9c-85c151c1d15c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1274.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1274.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1274.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1555","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1574","title":"IBM AIX nslookup 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"AIX 4.3 系统中 nslookup 工具的 lex 例程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者通过向 nslookup 输入超长字符串可触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序核心转储甚至执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3 版本，远程攻击者可在未授权情况下利用该漏洞实施攻击，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1574"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-07-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"安装 IBM APAR#IX79909 补丁以修复 AIX 4.3 nslookup lex 缓冲区溢出漏洞。AIX 4.3 已停止支持，建议升级至 AIX 7.2/7.3 等受支持版本。临时缓解措施：移除 nslookup 的 setuid 权限（chmod -s /usr/bin/nslookup），限制可执行 nslookup 的用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IX79909&apar=only","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/182777","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7867","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1574.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1574","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1574.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1574.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4cmx-6wc5-8grq/GHSA-4cmx-6wc5-8grq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83031/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1574.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1392","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1202","title":"StarTech POP3 Proxy Server与Telnet Server认证长用户名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"StarTech POP3 Proxy Server 和 Telnet Server 存在身份验证拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的身份验证模块发送超长的 USER 命令，触发缓冲区异常导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 StarTech POP3 Proxy Server 及 Telnet Server 相关版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击门槛低。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议限制受影响服务的访问来源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1202"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 StarTech POP3 Proxy Server 和 Telnet Server，改用主流维护中的替代方案（如 Dovecot、Postfix 等现代邮件代理）。如无法替换，应在网络边界防火墙配置规则，限制对 POP3 (110/TCP) 和 Telnet (23/TCP) 端口的来源 IP 白名单访问，防止任意来源的恶意连接。同时，在服务端程序层面建议实现输入长度检查，对 USER 命令参数做长度上限（如 ≤64 字节）截断校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221104525873&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2088","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1202.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1202","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1202.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1202.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3hqc-gjr5-73rx/GHSA-3hqc-gjr5-73rx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88605/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1202.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--31f64f7c-a00e-4f9b-a656-8fe2f130faa9.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1266","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1409","title":"NetBSD/SGI IRIX at 命令本地文件读取漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.2/6.5.1 及 NetBSD 1.3.2 及更早版本中的 at(1) 任务调度程序存在本地文件信息泄露漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 at 命令的 -f 参数传递任意文件路径，系统在执行调度时因文件内容不符合语法规则产生错误信息，这些错误输出将通过邮件发送给本地用户，从而实现读取任意文件的部分内容。该漏洞要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，但可能导致系统敏感信息（如配置文件、密码文件等）泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1409"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"NetBSD 用户应升级至 19980626 之后的内核版本，或应用官方补丁（ftp://ftp.NetBSD.ORG/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/patches/19980626-at）；SGI IRIX 用户应安装厂商提供的 at 修补程序。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/at 移除 at 的 setuid 位，此举会禁止普通用户使用 at 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90233906612929&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7577.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/331","http://www.shmoo.com/mail/bugtraq/jul98/msg00064.html","https://www